WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.476
Bird loved watching the circus.

2
00:00:05.477 --> 00:00:09.736
Kip loved watching it too.

3
00:00:09.737 --> 00:00:15.100
In fact, Kip wanted to be in it!

4
00:00:15.101 --> 00:00:21.074
Kip wanted to be an acrobat.

5
00:00:21.075 --> 00:00:27.080
He also wanted to be a tightrope walker.

6
00:00:27.081 --> 00:00:33.151
Soon a lion was led into the ring.

7
00:00:33.152 --> 00:00:36.290
Everyone got very quiet.

8
00:00:36.291 --> 00:00:39.280
The lion was large and scary.

9
00:00:39.281 --> 00:00:47.580
The lion growled and roared.

10
00:00:47.581 --> 00:00:50.946
A man stepped in front of the lion.

11
00:00:50.947 --> 00:00:53.817
The man was holding a chair.

12
00:00:53.818 --> 00:00:56.597
He was a lion tamer.

13
00:00:56.598 --> 00:01:00.309
The lion growled at the lion tamer.

14
00:01:00.310 --> 00:01:03.910
The lion roared at the lion tamer.

15
00:01:03.911 --> 00:01:07.361
But the lion tamer was not afraid.

16
00:01:07.362 --> 00:01:11.416
"Sit down," said the lion tamer.

17
00:01:11.417 --> 00:01:17.731
The lion sat down!

18
00:01:17.732 --> 00:01:22.020
"Roll over," said the lion tamer.

19
00:01:22.021 --> 00:01:25.953
The lion rolled over!

20
00:01:25.954 --> 00:01:29.263
"Psst, Bird," whispered Kip.

21
00:01:29.264 --> 00:01:37.500
"I would love to be in the circus.

22
00:01:37.501 --> 00:01:42.854
But I would not want to do that!"

